<h3><u>Aun-o-muhammad</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Aun-o-muhammad</u></strong></p>

<p>Kehti thi Zainab ay mere sheyro, kehti thi Zainab, mere dilero</p>

<p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x4</p>

<ol>
 <li>Khwaab ye Zainab ka tha, chaand sitare mere (chaand sitare) x2
 <p>Mamu pe hogaye fida, god ke pale mere (god ke pale) x2</p>

 <p>Khwaab ye sacha huwa, sar mere uncha raha, hone ko sheh par fida laal mere, sheyr mere chaand mere</p>

 <p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Jaffar-e-tayyar ke khun ke akkas ho (khun ke akkas) x2
 <p>Husn mei Akbar ho tum josh mei Abbas ho (Josh mei Abbas) x2</p>

 <p>Jang ke maydaan mei maut ke armaan mei, saya-e-Qur&#39;an mei, aise utho aise paro maut pe tum qud paro</p>

 <p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Ha meri tafeed par dhyan tumhara raho, (dhyaan tumhara) x2
 <p>Jake lab-e-nehr bhi pyaas gawara rahe (pyaas gawara) x2</p>

 <p>Dud na bakshungi mei, mu bhi na dekhungi mei, sheyr ki beti hu mei, wada karo aao chalo, tum na raho</p>

 <p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Maana ke pyaase ho tum, pyaas pe kabu rahe (pyaas pe kaabu) x2
 <p>Sheh ke alamdar ki, saans mei khushbu rahe (saans mei khushbu) x2</p>

 <p>Bas ye tamanna meri, laaj rahe khun ki, hai ye wasiyat meri, khawo qasam, jaawo hasham, hoga na kam</p>

 <p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Aun ye kehna laga, bhaayi Muhammad suno (bhaayi Muhammad) x2
 <p>Eik taraf mei baro, eik taraf tum barho (eik taraf tum) x2</p>

 <p>Jang ho fowj-e-sitam, jang kare aise ham, Maamu hame de alam, deke hame amma kahe jite rahe</p>

 <p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Dono jari jang ko surat-e-andhi bare, (surat-e-andhi) x2
 <p>Nana Ali ki tarha, maut pe havi rahe (maut pe havi) x2</p>

 <p>Milke jo hamla kiya, meymana-o-mesra, eik me dam hogaya, teygh-e-Ali, aise chali, dhum machi</p>

 <p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Dekh rahi thi jo maa khayme ke darpar khari, (khayme ke dar par) x2
 <p>Saath wahi the khare Hazrat-e-Abbas bhi, (Hazrat-e-Abbas) x2</p>

 <p>Bhaayi behen saath the, sahib-e-awlaad the, waris-e-ajdaad the, kehne lage khub lare sheyr mere</p>

 <p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Larte kaha tak bhala pyaas ke maare huwe (pyaas ke mare) x2
 <p>Jalti huwi khaak par dono tarapne laga (dono tarapne) x2</p>

 <p>Bhaayi se kehne lagi, fakhr se bint-e-Ali, surkhru Zainab huwi, sar pe tere bhaayi mere, laal huwe</p>

 <p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Aun-o-Muhammad na the, wo dur-e-nayaab the (wo dur-e-nayaab) x2</li>
</ol>

<p>&quot;Sarwar-o-Rehan&quot; wo wakif-e-adab the (wakif-e-adab) x2</p>

<p>Hukm jo maa ne diya rukh na kiya nehr ka, pyaas ka sadma saha, maa ne kaha shukhr-e-khuda, huwe fida</p>

<p>(Aun-o-muhammad mere, aun-o-muhammad) x2</p>
</p>